         <div class="page-header image-header" style="background-image: url(/_resources/images/placeholders/banner.jpg)">
            <div class="container">
               <div class="row">
                  <div class="col-12">
                     <h1>About Skyhawk Athletics</h1>
                  </div>
               </div>
            </div>
         </div>
         <div class="container">
            <div class="row">
               <div class="col-12">
                  <nav aria-label="breadcrumb">
                     <ol class="breadcrumb">
                        <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="/">Home</a></li>
                        <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="/athletics/">Athletics</a></li>
                        <li class="breadcrumb-item">About Skyhawk Athletics</li>
                     </ol>
                  </nav>
               </div>
            </div>
            <div class="row">
               <div class="col-lg-8 mb-5 order-1 order-lg-2">
                  <p><img class="" src="/athletics/_files/2019-20_athletes.jpg" alt="2019-20 SVCC Athletes" width="1000" height="563"></p>
                  
                  <p><img src="/athletics/_files/2011-skyhawk.png" alt="SVCC Skyhawk Icon" width="118" height="82" align="right"></p>
                  
                  <p>The mythical Skyhawk bird is a strong, fast, driven creature that is fierce yet cooperative
                     with others. This can be said of our athletes as well. We take pride in our athletics
                     as we offer 12 sports (six men's and six women's) at the highest level of the National
                     Junior College Athletic Association (NJCAA) competition.</p>
                  
                  <h3>Athletics Mission Statement</h3>
                  
                  <p>The Sauk Valley Community College Athletic Program will function as an integral part
                     of the College and the community, and will provide an environment that develops and
                     promotes academic, social and athletic excellence.</p>
                  
                  <h3>Vision</h3>
                  
                  <p>To provide the premier athletic program in the region that strives to reach the highest
                     level of success, serves as a positive community influence, and demonstrates a source
                     of pride for all students, faculty, staff and alumni.</p>
                  
                  <h3>Goals</h3>
                  
                  <ul>
                     
                     <li>Offer student-athletes the opportunity to compete at regional to national levels and
                        to strive for competitive excellence.</li>
                     
                     <li>Provide student athletes with support systems to promote academic success.</li>
                     
                     <li>Demonstrate integrity and promote a positive image of the athletic department to internal
                        and external constituencies.</li>
                     
                     <li>Provide staffing and resources that facilitate athletic success.</li>
                     
                     <li>Adhere to athletic and academic guidelines of the NJCAA, Region IV, the Arrowhead
                        Conference and Sauk Valley Community College.</li>
                     
                     <li>Recruit competitive and diverse rosters.</li>
                     </ul>
                  
                  <p><a href="/athletics/equity-in-athletics-disclosure-act-report.html">Equity in Athletics Disclosure Report</a></p>
                  
                  <p>&nbsp;</p>
                  
                  <h2>SVCC Athletics Sports Books</h2>
                  
                  <p style="display: flex; gap: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap;"><a class="no-after" href="/athletics/about/_files/2021-2022_Winter-Spring-sports-book.pdf"><img src="/athletics/_files/2021-2022_winter-spring-sports-book_cover.jpg" alt="2021-22 Winter Spring Sports Guide" width="300" height="391"></a> <a class="no-after" href="/athletics/about/_files/2019-2020-winter-spring-sports.pdf"><img src="/athletics/_files/2019-2020-winter-spring-sports-book_cover.png" alt="2019-20 Winter Spring Sports Guide" width="300" height="391"></a></p>
               </div>
